Name: MOLE P-256 Cryptographic Primitives (mole-p256-rs)
Short Name: mole-p256-rs
URL: https://github.com/Moderation-of-unLinkable-Endorsements/mole-p256-rs.git
Version: 0.1.0
Revision: 230a96e62bfa324295e8e9e06514c64a8daf161d
License: Apache-2.0 AND MIT
License File: src/LICENSE-APACHE, src/LICENSE-MIT
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes

Description:
Upstream Rust implementation of the MOLE cryptographic schemes over NIST P-256
using BoringSSL (`bssl_sys`) via the `boringssl` Cargo feature:
  * `mole-p256`: P-256 group arithmetic, RFC 9380 hash-to-curve, SHA-256, RNG
  * `ec-ihat`: `draft-ladd-mole-ec-ihat-00` (`0x0002`)
  * `ec-act`: `draft-schlesinger-mole-ec-act-00` (`0x0001`, `2^L` range proofs,
    `EVP_shake128` via BoringSSL)

Local Modifications:
None (`src/` is an unmodified copy of upstream `230a96e62bfa324295e8e9e06514c64a8daf161d`).
